Third-party notices
====================

The Scalvs.ai Metatron bot can download two optional geo datasets published by
the v2fly project. The datasets are not stored in this repository. The fetch
script writes them under data/geo/, which is gitignored. Geo routing is off
unless an operator turns it on.

This product does not use Loyalsoldier or sing-box geo data.

